	View '{%viewKey%}' (design §4.8). Scaffolded by `atlas new view {%key%}` on {%today%}.
	Gets StageProps from StageHost. Rules: no autoplay when ctx.reduced; call onend() when an autoplay finishes;
	nothing understandable only while animating; no horizontal scroll at 360 px; do not trap keys.
